('anker-prime-20k-powerbank', 'Anker Prime 20000mAh 200W Power Bank', 'power', 75000, 75000, 61500, 40, 0.48, '/assets/products/anker-prime-20k-powerbank.jpg', 'The Anker Prime 20000mAh is a technological marvel packing 200W total output across two USB-C ports (100W each) and one USB-A port (65W). The smart digital display shows real-time wattage, remaining capacity, and estimated time to full recharge. Charges a MacBook Pro at full 100W speed, an iPhone 16 Pro Max to 50% in 23 minutes, and two laptops simultaneously at 100W each. Anker''s GaNPrime technology and ActiveShield 3.0 temperature monitoring ensure safe, efficient charging. The 20000mAh capacity provides 1.3 full MacBook Air charges or 4 smartphone charges. Recharges itself at 100W in just 37 minutes via dual USB-C input. Aircraft-safe 72Wh capacity, premium aluminum alloy and matte finish construction, and included 100W USB-C cable. Anker''s industry-leading 24-month warranty and multi-protection safety system. The ultimate high-performance power bank for professionals and power users who demand speed, capacity, and intelligence.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 61500, '/assets/products/anker-prime-20k-powerbank.jpg', 67650, 4.8, 1, 'Anker', 1, 1),

